        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Medical Plans. In designated locations, the Company provides employees with a choice among medical plans. The Traditional Medical Plan offers enhanced benefits when a member of its network is used. Coordinated care plans also rely on selected networks of providers.",
